# License — Best AI Agent

> **Status: Pending owner confirmation.**
>
> The prior `README.md` stated "Proprietary — All rights reserved." and `package.json`
> had no `license` field. That proprietary status is **preserved** here unchanged —
> no open-source license (MIT, Apache-2.0, etc.) is granted by this file.
>
> ## Why this file exists

This file documents the licensing state honestly:

- `package.json` declares `"license": "UNLICENSED"`, the npm convention indicating a
  proprietary / not-for-public-distribution package. This **preserves** the prior
  "Proprietary — All rights reserved" status documented in README history. It is
  **not** a silent license change.
- The repository's open-source presentation work (README, CONTRIBUTING, community-health
  files) has been done with the goal of making the project **deserve** open-source
  adoption. Whether the owner formally relicenses to an OSI-approved license (e.g.
  MIT, Apache-2.0) is a decision only the owner can make. Until then, no open-source
  license is granted.

## What you may do today

- **Read and study the source** for evaluation purposes.
- **Open issues, PRs, and discussions** per [`CONTRIBUTING.md`](CONTRIBUTING.md).
  Contributions are accepted on a per-commit basis per the maintainer's guidance in the
  PR, pending the licensing decision.

## What you may NOT do today

- You may **not** redistribute, sublicense, commercially use, or create derivative works
  of this codebase in a way not authorized by the owner.
- No contributor other than the owner (`@CodesbyFebin`) may assert a license on this
  repository. (See [`GOVERNANCE.md`](GOVERNANCE.md) §Decision making.)

## How this will be updated

When the owner confirms an open-source license, this file will be replaced with that
license's standard text (e.g. the MIT or Apache-2.0 license body), `package.json`'s
`license` field will be updated to match, and the change will be noted in
[`CHANGELOG.md`](CHANGELOG.md). Until then, the proprietary status stands.

## Evidence

- Prior `README.md` (commit `a54d4fa`): "License: Proprietary — All rights reserved."
- `AUDIT.md` §O.2: licensing decision flagged as `[CRITICAL — identity]` and gated on owner confirmation.

